    "url": "https://jobs.lever.co/amanotes/340ca3e8-c264-4150-8f7a-628477a24381",
    "desc": "LOCATION\n\nHCM Onsite (Relocation Support)\n\nABOUT THE JOB\n\nWe're looking for a Senior UA Marketing (Mobile Apps) to own and scale user growth across our AI and Utility app portfolio. You'll manage significant advertising budgets, optimize performance across multiple channels, and play a key role in driving product growth in global markets.\n\nWHAT YOU WILL DO\n• Own and execute UA strategy across the company for a portfolio of 3-5 mobile apps titles, managing large-scale budgets on channels such as Meta, Google Ads, TikTok, Unity Ads, IronSource, AppLovin, DSPs, and more\n\n• Act as your team’s expert in one of Meta, Tiktok, Google UAC, or SDK networks, meeting regularly with our stakeholders while actively running campaigns that hit KPI & ROAS targets and grow daily active users\n\n• Define UA launch strategies for new titles, including pre-registration campaigns\n\n• Define conceptual creative strategies and testing processes\n\n• Collaborate closely with Product, Monetization, Creative, and Data teams to drive growth\n\n• Stay ahead of trends by conducting market research and competitive analysis\n\n*** Duties and responsibilities outlined above are representative, but not all-inclusive.\n\nQUALIFICATIONS\n• 3+ years of hands-on UA experience in mobile app industry\n\n• Strong preference for candidates with experience in UA for apps in Utility or AI genre\n\n• Deep knowledge of the mobile growth stack: MMPs, mediation, analytics, SDK ad networks, DSPs, etc.\n\n• Self-driven, be able to communicate goals, needs, and reports that provide insight into game performance and recommendations on improving metrics relevant to user acquisition campaigns\n\n• Experience with ad monetization and strong working relationships with various ad networks on both the monetization and user acquisition side.\n\n• Fluent English (written + speaking) is a must\n\nTO COMPLEMENT OUR TEAM, YOU SHOULD BE\n\n• You are on top of the latest apps, trends, and what’s happening in live events\n\n• Solution-oriented, self-motivated and have the attitude to get things done\n\n• Comfortable with uncertainties and changes in a fast-paced environment\n\n• Curious, proactive learning and knowledge-hungry learner\n\nWHAT WE OFFER\nWe take care of our people — from meaningful reward to everyday experience at work\n\nFinancial\n\n•\nCompetitive salary, 100% pay during probation\n\n•\nPerformance bonus with up to 30% of company profit shared — no cap\n\n•\nFull SHUI + premium private health insurance & annual check-up\n\nPersonal Well-being\n\n•\n12 days annual leave + 10 days paid sick leave\n\n•\n12 WFH days per year for when you need flexibility\n\n•\n9.4M VND yearly flexi-budget for your personal development\n\n•\nFree daily lunch (10+ options)\n\n•\nSnacks, drinks, and tea-time always available\n\n•\nMonthly/bi-monthly team bonding budget\n\n•\nSports activities (badminton, football, etc.)\n\nPersonal Development\n\n•\nCompany learning trips to top markets (Korea first, Japan next)\n\n•\nSponsored access to international conferences & industry events\n\n•\nModern equipment + AI tools to help you work smarter and grow faster\n\nRELOCATION SUPPORT\nThis position is based in our Ho Chi Minh City office — but don't let that stop you from applying. If you're the right person for this role, we'd love to make the move work for you. Relocation support is available, and we'll work out the details together during the offer stage.\"\nCONSENT NOTICE FOR PERSONAL DATA PROCESSING\n\n• By applying to any position at Uplive, you acknowledge and agree that your personal data will be collected and processed for recruitment-related purposes. Please read the “ Consent Notice for Personal Data Processing ” carefully before submitting your application.• Thank you for your interest in joining Uplive!\n\nHow To Apply?\n\nClick the button or contact us at talents@uplive.zone",
