    "desc": "We're looking for a talented Game Artist to join our Game team and create eye-catching visuals for our mobile games!\n\nYou'll possess a keen eye for detail and a knack for crafting compelling graphics that resonate with mobile audiences.\n\nCollaborate with the Product team, you'll research and design UI/UX and game assets that bring our mobile games to life and engage players worldwide.\n\nWHAT YOU WILL DO\n• Design user interfaces (UI) that are visually appealing, intuitive, and user-friendly for mobile games.\n\n• Collaborate closely with Developers, and Product Owners to ensure a cohesive and delightful player experience.\n\n• Stay up-to-date on mobile games UI/UX trends and best practices, continuously improving the game's usability and aesthetics.\n\n• (Optional) Assist Marketing Team to prepare the material such as icons, screenshots, etc.\n\nQUALIFICATION\n• Technical skills requirements:\n\n• Minimum 2-3 years working with Graphic design softwares (Photoshop, Illustrator, Figma..).\n\n• Can independently conduct research, update knowledge about mobile game trends.\n\n• Having experience working in UI/UX design is a plus.\n\n• Having experience working with the Mobile Game industry is a plus.\n\n• Having experience working in animation design is a plus.\n\n• Graduated in Graphic Design, Game Design or related fields.\n\n• Basic knowledge and passion for music, digital marketing, and mobile games.\n\n• Soft skills requirements:\n\n• A reliable person and able to work independently, with responsibility.\n\n• A creative person, flexible and adaptive to work with multiple games portfolio.\n\n• A communicative person who can discuss with the team about their ideas, projects and negotiate feedback effectively.\n\n• An energetic and open-minded collaborator.\n\n• A multi-tasker, who proactively seeks out opportunities to support the team.\n\n• Portfolio is required as part of the application\n\nWHAT WE OFFER\n• Competitive salary, 100% salary during probation\n\n• Performance bonus with 30% of company profit shared with no cap\n\n• Full SHUI as Vietnamese Law + Premium Private Medical Insurance and annual health check\n\n• Minimum 12 days paid annual leave + 10 days paid sick leave.\n\n• 12 days working from home per year\n\n• Annual flexi-budget (9.400.000 VNĐ/year) for well-being & personal development\n\n• Free daily lunch with 10+ menu options.\n\n• Free daily F&B: Snacks, juice, beverage, tea-time\n\n• Monthly/Bi-monthly team activity allowance\n\n• Company learning trip will be top of countries that we gain most profit. 1st is Korea, next destination is Japan\n\n• Sponsored sports activities: badminton, soccer, ...\n\n• Sponsored overseas conferences and industry events for all levels.\n\n• ••Modern equipments/AI tool provided.\nHow To Apply?\n\nClick the button or contact us at talents@uplive.zone",
