    "desc": "\nOBJECTIVES\n• To lead the impact of data science on different areas of business, that include data management, data analytics & data innovations through Machine Learning, AI\n\n• Being the visionaries & execution driver of all data-enabled initiatives in Amanotes. Provide transformative direction and the general technical leadership for Amanotes Data Ecosystem. Coordinate cross-function to leverage data to achieve impactful business outcomes\n\nWHAT YOU WILL DO\n•\nData Management\n\n•\nSupervise the data and information system to ensure adequacy, accuracy, and legitimacy of data products (including but not limited to: reports, insights, analytics tools, models)\n\n•\nEstablish & Supervise Amanotes data governance and policies\n\n•\nFacilitate & Communicate Data Visions and Strategies across functions & business units\n\n•\nData Operations (Data Supports)\n\n•\nAnticipate the upcoming trends and business demands to propose impactful data deliverables\n\n•\nSupervise the pipeline to deliver data with high quality, timeliness, usefulness; to enable data usability, availability, and efficiency on the Information System (BI, Reportings, Dashboard)\n\n•\nEnsure Data Support Excellence in performing data ad-hoc requests\n\n•\nOversee the end-to-end MLOps lifecycle, including automated pipeline deployment for model training, evaluation, and inference at scale\n\n•\nImplement robust monitoring and alerting frameworks to track model health, data drift, and performance degradation in production\n\n•\nData Analytics & Insights\n\n•\nDefine Analytics opportunities to support the growth of Amanotes\n\n•\nDevelop the Analytics Capacities in Amanotes: Through Data & Data Science techniques, Mastering knowledge about our customers, products, and business\n\nQUALIFICATIONS\n•\nBachelor's degree in Data Science, Computer Science, Information Technology, Economics, Statistics, Applied Math, Business Administration, or any other related field\n\n•\n3-5 years experience in a senior-level data management role\n\n•\nExperience in designing, managing, and delivering data solutions with a proven track record of managing end-to-end delivery from ideation to R&D to production with multiple stakeholders involved (managing timelines, development, deliverables, and expectations)\n\n•\nExperience in managing senior stakeholders and communicating complex, technical information in an engaging way to both technical and non-technical audiences\n\n•\nTechnical understanding or enthusiasm in areas of BI, AI (Incl. Machine Learning), Reporting and visualization, infrastructure, architecture, and governance, are appreciated\n\n•\nDemonstrated leadership ability, confidence, and executive presence – ability to lead and motivate employees within the organization\n\n•\nExcellent analytical, problem-solving, and data analysis skills\n\n•\nHigh Adaptability (quick-learner & able to adapt quickly with changes in high uncertainty environment)\n\n•\nRadical open-mindedness and radical transparency\n\n•\nExcellent verbal and written communication, in English and Vietnamese\n\n•\nProven experience with MLOps tools (e.g., MLflow, Kubeflow, DVC) and implementing CI/CD pipelines for machine learning automation\n\n•\nStrong understanding of cloud infrastructure (GCP/AWS) and infrastructure-as-code for managing ML production environments\n\n•\nHigh level of strategic thinking & critical thinking\n\n•\nExceptional team management skills\n\nWILL BE A PLUS\n•\nMaster’s degree or Ph.D. in Data Analytics, Data Scientists, or related fields\n\n•\nWorking experience related to the mobile/music/game industry is a plus\n\n•\nKnowledge of Modern Data Stacks, i.e. GCP, AWS, and MLOps is a plus\n\n•\nPassion for Music (such as playing musical instruments and love to sing karaoke) is a huge asset\n\n•\nShowcase in designing initiatives and leading the organization’s data strategy\n\nBENEFITS\nAt Amanotes, you will be enjoying the dynamic working environment with unique music culture many benefits as below:\n\n• Competitive salary upon experience\n\n• 13th-month salary\n\n• Year-end Bonus\n\n• ESOP\n\n• Flexible working time\n\n• Personal learning and well-being budget\n\n• Team-building budget\n\n• Lunch and parking allowance\n\n• Various learning activities, including internal training & sharing, international conferences, and e-learning (Udemy, Linkedin Learning...)\n\n• Engaging music events: Music Night, Amasing Night, Music schools…\n\n• Employee Assistance Program to support mental health & well-being\n\n• Minimum 12 days of paid annual leave, plus 10 days of paid sick leave\n\n• 12 days working from home per year\nConsent Notice for Personal Data Processing\n- By applying to any position at Amanotes, you acknowledge and agree that your personal data will be collected and processed for recruitment-related purposes. Please read the “Consent Notice for Personal Data Processing” carefully before submitting your application.\n- Thank you for your interest in joining Amanotes.\n\nAbout Amanotes\n\nWe are Amanotes – a dynamic music game company that’s using cutting-edge technology to transform how people experience music.\n\nSince 2014, we’ve led the global simple music game market with over 3.5 billion downloads across 190+ countries, including chart-topping titles like Magic Tiles 3, Tiles Hop, Dancing Road, and Duet Cats.\n\nAs the #1 Music Game Publisher worldwide and the #1 App Publisher from Southeast Asia by downloads, our ambition is clear: to create iconic, hybrid-casual music games that people love and play for years.\n\nWhat truly sets Amanotes apart is not just what we build — it’s how we grow and who we grow with:\n\n🎓 We invest in your growth through learning budgets, coaching, and stretch opportunities.\n\n🎶 We embrace a creative and dynamic culture, where everyone can play, share, and thrive.\n\n🧘 We believe in work-life harmony — your rhythm matters here.\n\n🏆 We recognize and reward impact, with competitive benefits and clear development paths.\n\nCome join our music-filled workplace, where innovation meets rhythm — and let’s create a magical music experience together.\n\nAmanotes – Wher",
